<title>BRAZIL: Brazil stocks pare gains to close slightly up.</title>
<headline>Brazil stocks pare gains to close slightly up.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil shares pared early gains to end up 0.10 percent with bellwether Telebras leading the rise, traders said.</p>
<p>The Bovespa index  .BVSP of the 49 most traded shares ended up 70 points at 67,046 points. Turnover was thin at 389.7 million reais ($379.8 million).</p>
